<div class="consent" id="consent" role="dialog" aria-modal="false" aria-labelledby="consent-h" hidden>
    <div class="cz-head">
        <span class="cz-ico" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path d="M24 4a20 20 0 1 0 20 20 7 7 0 0 1-8-7 7 7 0 0 1-7-8 5 5 0 0 1-5-5z" fill="#F7A11A"/><path d="M24 4a20 20 0 1 0 20 20 7 7 0 0 1-8-7 7 7 0 0 1-7-8 5 5 0 0 1-5-5z" fill="none" stroke="#D98300" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="20" r="3" fill="#7A3E00"/><circle cx="20" cy="32" r="2.6" fill="#7A3E00"/><circle cx="31" cy="30" r="3" fill="#7A3E00"/><circle cx="12" cy="29" r="1.6" fill="#7A3E00"/><circle cx="27" cy="38" r="1.6" fill="#7A3E00"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div>
            <p class="cz-kicker">Malo kolačića za bolje putovanje</p>
            <h2 id="consent-h" class="cz-title">Vaša privatnost nam je važna</h2>
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="cz-text">Koristimo neophodne kolačiće da sajt radi, a uz vašu dozvolu i kolačiće za mjerenje posjeta i oglase, da vam pokažemo putovanja koja vas zanimaju. Više u <a href="politika-privatnosti">politici privatnosti</a>.</p>

    <div class="cz-prefs" id="cz-prefs" hidden>
        <label class="cz-row is-locked">
            <span><b>Neophodni</b><small>Rad sajta, forme i vaš izbor kolačića. Uvijek uključeni.</small></span>
            <input type="checkbox" checked disabled><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </label>
        <label class="cz-row">
            <span><b>Analitika</b><small>Google Analytics: koliko posjeta imamo i šta vas zanima (anonimno).</small></span>
            <input type="checkbox" data-cz="a"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </label>
        <label class="cz-row">
            <span><b>Marketing</b><small>Meta (Facebook, Instagram): oglasi za putovanja koja ste gledali.</small></span>
            <input type="checkbox" data-cz="m"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </label>
    </div>

    <div class="cz-btns">
        <button type="button" class="cz-link" data-cz-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="cz-prefs">Postavke</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost cz-btn" data-consent="no">Samo neophodni</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sun cz-btn" data-consent="yes">Prihvati sve</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sun cz-btn" data-consent="save" hidden>Sačuvaj izbor</button>
    </div>
</div>
